@startuml AD3_PlayExpertAudio
!include act.iuml
title Activity Diagram – Play Expert Audio
|User|
start
:Press "Play expert audio";
|Faseeh System|
:Get reciter clip\n(getExpertAudioClip);
if () then ([clip loaded])
  :Play reciter audio\nand show reciter name\n(getReciterName);
